{
  "id": "jira",
  "name": {
    "default": "Jira",
    "zh": "Jira 工单",
    "ja": "Jira 課題"
  },
  "description": {
    "default": "My assigned Jira issues, grouped by status. Connects via Atlassian REST API + API token.",
    "zh": "分配给我的 Jira 工单，按状态分桶。用 Atlassian REST API + API token 直连（零外部 CLI）。",
    "ja": "自分にアサインされた Jira 課題。Atlassian REST API + API トークンで直接接続。"
  },
  "docs": "# Jira 工单\n\n只读看板：展示「分配给我」的 Jira 工单，按状态分三桶（进行中 / 待办 / 完成）。\n\n## 连接\n\n点工具栏齿轮（⚙）打开设置，填：\n- **Site**: 你的 Atlassian 域名，如 `yourteam.atlassian.net`\n- **Email**: 你的 Atlassian 账号邮箱\n- **API token**: 去 https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens 建一个\n\ntoken 存进平台 Keychain（secrets 能力，非明文）；site/email 存 settings。app 不写存储代码。\n\n## 数据来源\n\n后台 job（每 10 分钟 + 开窗即刷）经 Atlassian REST API 拉：\n\n```\nPOST https://<site>/rest/api/3/search/jql\n  Authorization: Basic base64(email:token)\n  { jql: \"assignee = currentUser() ORDER BY updated DESC\", fields: [...] }\n```\n\n按 `key` upsert 进 `issues`；本轮未命中的（已关闭/转派）自动删除。`status.statusCategory`（new/indeterminate/done）精确分三桶。\n\n## 只读\n\nAgent 写库，用户浏览 + 点击跳 Jira 网页。\n",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "renderer": "auto",
  "author": "agent-rt",
  "category": "productivity",
  "keywords": [
    "jira",
    "issues",
    "atlassian",
    "api-token"
  ],
  "icon": "https://api.iconify.design/ph/kanban-fill.svg?color=%230052cc&width=256",
  "permissions": [
    "data:read",
    "data:write",
    "secrets:read",
    "secrets:write",
    "settings:read",
    "settings:write"
  ],
  "min_runtime": "0.3.0",
  "window": {
    "style": "phone",
    "width": 440,
    "height": 780,
    "resizable": false
  },
  "jobs": [
    {
      "id": "ingest",
      "run": "ingest",
      "every": "10m",
      "while": "always"
    }
  ],
  "collections": {
    "issues": {
      "schema": {
        "key": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "summary": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bucket": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "created": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "updated": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "due": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "due_overdue": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "due_soon": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "due_later": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "indexes": [
        "key",
        "bucket",
        "type",
        "status",
        "updated",
        "due"
      ]
    },
    "sync": {
      "schema": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "has_error": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "err": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "needs_auth": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "connected_email": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "refreshed_text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ts": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "indexes": [
        "id"
      ]
    }
  },
  "auth": {
    "groups": [
      {
        "title": "Jira Connection",
        "help": "Read-only board of issues assigned to you. Create an API token at id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens.",
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "site",
            "label": "Site",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "yourteam.atlassian.net",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "key": "email",
            "label": "Email",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "you@company.com",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "key": "jira_token",
            "label": "API token",
            "type": "secret",
            "required": true,
            "help": "Stored in the system Keychain."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
